invalid type: string "400 Level  The instructor and/or graduate studies committee of the school \nshall be in charge of the conduct of the summative examination \nfor 400 Level courses. \nThe valuation shall be conducted by a committee of two \nfaculty members. \nThe valuation shall be based on  an open seminar and term \nreport submitted by the student. \n \nnd/or written exams with at \nnics. \n